  "contract": [
    "Compare all fixed fields, font identifiers and raw font-name ranges and bytes, and the kinds, ranges and bytes of all child boxes, under ETSI TS 126 245 \u00a75.16. Test the defaults record, sample entry body, and Unicode font mode."
